        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 22:6",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And David said to Solomon, My son, as for me, it was in my mind to build an house unto the name of the Lord my God:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 63,
            "text": "2 Sam. 7:3 (3–5)."
          },
          {
            "start": 76,
            "end": 81,
            "text": "Ps. 132:5 (1–5)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 22:7",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "But the word of the Lord came to me, saying, Thou hast shed blood abundantly, and hast made great wars: thou shalt not build an house unto my name, because thou hast shed much blood upon the earth in my sight.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 22:8",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, a son shall be born to thee, who shall be a man of rest; and I will give him rest from all his enemies round about: for his name shall be Solomon, and I will give peace and quietness unto Israel in his days.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 89,
            "text": "1 Kgs. 4:24 (24–25); 5:4."
          },
          {
            "start": 146,
            "end": 153,
            "text": "2 Sam. 12:24 (24–25); 1 Kgs. 1:13 (11–14)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 22:9",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "He shall build an house for my name; and he shall be my son, and I will be his father; and I will establish the throne of his kingdom over Israel for ever.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "1 Kgs. 6:12."
          },
          {
            "start": 126,
            "end": 133,
            "text": "1 Kgs. 2:15."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 74
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [
